gui.wormholetech.tablet.p2.l1=[Translation] Matter path (craft the ore, mine it, then refine):
gui.wormholetech.tablet.p2.l2=[Translation] Synthetic Ore -> Raw Naquadah (25%%) -> Refined Naquadah (explode the raw item).

